# PR-A (June 2026): exception for CI baseline logs in the operational
# reports directory. These logs are deliberately committed as a stable
# baseline for the wave-tracker pass-rate check (PR-CI-WAVE-ALLOWLIST,
# July 2026) so the next-run can diff against the previous baseline
# without needing `git add -f` bypass per AGENTS.md Git-Lesson-2
# minimum-ripple. The negation rule MUST stay directly after `*.log`
# so git's last-match-wins semantics apply.
!tests/operational/REPORTS/*.log
*.tmp
tmp/
logs/
**/__pycache__/

